From f6e4212bce1ab146d253a00da4f95950d8a6df2b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ian MacDonald <ian@netstatz.com>
Date: Tue, 21 Jul 2026 12:33:03 -0400
Subject: [PATCH 01/91] feat: add LiteRT backend (litert-lm-server subprocess,
 system PATH binary)

New 'litert' recipe backend that launches litert-lm-server (an OpenAI-compatible
HTTP server over LiteRT-LM's C ABI) as a subprocess and forwards chat/completions
to it. System PATH-binary model (no downloadable artifact); CPU; x86_64/ARM64
Linux; experimental. Adds a Qwen3-0.6B .litertlm model entry.

Assisted-by: claude:opus-4.8
